    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create a Python script that writes a structured JSON log event to a managed logging service, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use Amazon CloudWatch Logs as the provider because it is a widely used managed logging service. The script will import the necessary AWS SDK (Boto3) and use it to send a log event to CloudWatch Logs. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789849944253,
          "start": 1789849940944
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb5eb3d0001LlqWaCm31clUWa",
